  "content_en": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "hint",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 360,
        "height": 250,
        "text": "A/B testing\nThe path from two groups to a verdict: visits and conversions of the groups → shares, significance and effect → test duration. Change any number — the chain recomputes itself.\nThe double line «Control → Conversions» is a bundle of value edges: click opens the main stage with «Object.Field» addresses.",
        "color": "4"
      },
      {
        "id": "control",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 420,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 200,
        "text": "Control\nCurrent version: visits and conversions of group A — raw data from analytics.\n\nvisitors_a = 10000\nconversions_a = 200",
        "color": "5"
      },
      {
        "id": "variant",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 760,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 200,
        "text": "Variant\nNew version: visits and conversions of group B — the thing under test.\n\nvisitors_b = 10000\nconversions_b = 260",
        "color": "5"
      },
      {
        "id": "verdict",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 1100,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 340,
        "height": 250,
        "text": "Verdict\np ≈ 0.0047 < 0.05: variant B is significantly better — lift +30%, on the same traffic that is +60 conversions, +720 per year.\nKeep going: plug in the actual visits; at p ≥ 0.05 there is no effect — continue the test or grow the sample (the «Planning» card).",
        "color": "4"
      },
      {
        "id": "rates",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 420,
        "y": 300,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 190,
        "text": "Conversions\nGroup shares — values arrive line by line via value edges.\n\ncr_a = $conversions_a / $visitors_a\ncr_b = $conversions_b / $visitors_b",
        "color": "2"
      },
      {
        "id": "significance",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 760,
        "y": 300,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 210,
        "text": "Significance\nTwo-sided p-value of the pooled z-test and the relative lift: p < 0.05 — the difference is significant.\n\np_value = ab_pvalue($ca, $na, $cb, $nb)\nlift = ab_lift($ca, $na, $cb, $nb)",
        "color": "2"
      },
      {
        "id": "effect",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 1140,
        "y": 300,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 210,
        "text": "Effect\nGain in percentage points and extra conversions on the same traffic — from shares and lift.\n\nextra_pp = ($cr_b - $cr_a) × 100\nmonthly = $lift × $conversions_a",
        "color": "2"
      },
      {
        "id": "projection",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 1500,
        "y": 300,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 200,
        "text": "Projection\nExtrapolation of the effect to a quarter and a year.\n\nquarter = $monthly × 3\nyear = $monthly × 12",
        "color": "2"
      },
      {
        "id": "planner",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 1100,
        "y": 570,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "text": "Planning\nMinimum sample per group BEFORE the start: baseline 2%, MDE +10%, alpha 5%, power 80%.\n\nn = ab_sample_size(0.02, 0.10, 0.05, 0.80)",
        "color": "5"
      },
      {
        "id": "traffic",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 1460,
        "y": 570,
        "width": 260,
        "height": 180,
        "text": "Traffic\nAvailable traffic per day, both groups combined.\n\ndaily = 2400",
        "color": "5"
      },
      {
        "id": "duration",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 1780,
        "y": 570,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 190,
        "text": "Duration\nHow many days are needed: both groups × n over the daily traffic.\n\ndays = 2 × $n / $daily\nweeks = days / 7",
        "color": "2"
      }
    ],
